From eff5c721e59d74a8b59f8b81da0c4432e96f79f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nassos Yiannopoulos <nassosyian@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:27:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/54] hw/display: add pvg-linux-pci tracer skeleton

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
